<title>UK: UK gilt auction announcement -- full details.</title>
<headline>UK gilt auction announcement -- full details.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced</p>
<p>by the Bank of England</p>
<p>ISSUER: H M Treasury</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 2.5 BLN STG</p>
<p>COUPON: 8.0 PCT</p>
<p>MATURITY: 2021</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE: FEBRUARY 26</p>
<p>NOTES: The gilts are fully fungible with the stock already in issue and will be strippable when an official gilts strip facility is introduced.</p>
<p>Dividend dates June 7 and December 7. Matures June 7 2021.</p>
<p>-- Rosemary Bennett +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
